      "_comment_TODO_1": "Terraform's state account. Needs Get/Put/Delete on OBJECTS in the state bucket, and ListBucket on the BUCKET itself. Those are two different resource ARN shapes and getting them confused is the usual first failure: arn:aws:s3:::bucket vs arn:aws:s3:::bucket/*",
